sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 客户端
    participant V as ClaimView
    participant S as ClaimService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>V: POST /api/auth/claim (JWT + anon_id)
    V->>V: 解析 JWT 得到 user
    V->>S: claim(user, anon_id)
    S->>DB: 查找 Player(anon_id)
    alt 不存在
        S->>DB: create Player(anon_id, user=user)
    else 已被其它账号绑定
        DB-->>S: 冲突
        S-->>V: 冲突
        V-->>C: 409
    else 可绑定
        S->>DB: Player.user = user, save
        Note over S,DB: 历史反馈/遥测经外键自动归属
        S-->>V: 成功
        V-->>C: 200 + 绑定后档案信息
    end
